  "status": "hand",
  "note": "FreebiesUI free design resources: one page per freebie (Figma/Sketch/XD/PSD UI kits, app designs, mockups, icons, web templates, fonts, code) at /<family>/<name> or /<family>/<category>/<name>; the 24 <family>/<category> pages are category listings (excluded) and the ~1,086 /<freebie>/attachment/<file> sub-pages are per-file pages left out. The host also carries injected SEO-spam paths (/all-freebies/<casino article>, /bh*, /bahis*, …) — not included"
